e you can put in fantasy plus you  can have dragons sanderson plans to  bring his own magic to life entertaining  offers for tv and film rights for his  books most of which are set in an  interconnected universe called the  cosmere i got really lucky in that right  around the time i released i finally  sold a book in 2003 and it came out in  2005.  two years later a big revolution in  entertainment happened  yes  uh so we're talking marvel we're talking  marvel the marvel cinematic universe  happened and  because of that people are like oh we  love interconnected characters in worlds  and meanwhile i had been doing this for  a few years and people just latched on  to it well what is the big dream the big  dream the big dream is to um to be stan  lee  do you know stan lee  who doesn't know stanley i would love to  be stan lee the person whose stories  have changed millions of lives that are  beloved they've been retold time and  time and time again that bring so much  joy and fond memories to people's lives  that's who i would like to be whether i  can do it or not is another question but  that's my aspiration i believe he's on  his way but this is the best part of the  story so he first started writing that  that those books in secret  and the first novel was actually just  for his wife  she read it really loved it she said  honey you gotta share that's cheers and  he keeps sharing i love that

